g>Blockchain Ledger</strong> works</li>\n275:                         <li>• Analyze <strong>AI Fraud Risk</strong> and anomaly rules</li>\n276:                     </ul>\n277:                 </div>\n278:             </div>\n279: \n280:             <div class=\"ai-quick-prompts\">\n281:                 <button onclick=\"sendAiPrompt('Check Sarah Jenkins credential')\">Check Sarah</button>\n282:                 <button onclick=\"sendAiPrompt('Why is Marcus Vance revoked?')\">Check Marcus</button>\n283:                 <button onclick=\"sendAiPrompt('How does the blockchain protect credentials?')\">Explain Blockchain</button>\n284:             </div>\n285: \n286:             <div class=\"ai-chat-input-row\">\n287:                 <input type=\"text\" id=\"aiChatInput\" placeholder=\"Ask anything about credential verification...\" onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') sendAiMessage()\">\n288:                 <button class=\"btn-primary btn-sm\" onclick=\"sendAiMessage()\">Send</button>\n289:             </div>\n290:         </div>\n291:     </div>\n292: \n293:     <!-- Modern Footer -->\n294:     <footer class=\"footer\">\n295:         <div class=\"container footer-content\">\n296:             <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n297:                 <div class=\"brand-logo\">🎓</div>\n298:                 <div>\n299:                     <h4 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #fff;\">DevOps Qualification Verification System</h4>\n300:                     <p style=\"margin: 0.25rem 0 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8;\">High-Integrity Academic & Professional Credential Infrastructure</p>\n301:                 </div>\n302:             </div>\n303:             <div class=\"footer-links\">\n304:                 <a href=\"/swagger-ui.html\" target=\"_blank\">Swagger OpenAPI</a>\n305:                 <a href=\"/actuator/health\" target=\"_blank\">Health Status</a>\n306:                 <a href=\"/audit\">Audit Trail</a>\n307:                 <a href=\"/dashboard\">Instit