{"step_index":364,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:47:12Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T21:47:12+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T21:47:12+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/java/com/devops/qvs/service/AiFraudDetectionService.java`\nTotal Lines: 308\nTotal Bytes: 17063\nShowing lines 155 to 275\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n155:      */\n156:     public AiChatResponse processUserQuery(AiChatRequest request) {\n157:         String rawMsg = request.getMessage() != null ? request.getMessage().trim() : \"\";\n158:         String msg = rawMsg.toLowerCase();\n159:         LocalDateTime now = LocalDateTime.now();\n160: \n161:         // 1. Role Access Levels and Permission Matrix\n162:         if (msg.contains(\"access\") || msg.contains(\"role\") || msg.contains(\"permission\")\n163:                 || msg.contains(\"difference\") || (msg.contains(\"admin\") && msg.contains(\"officer\"))) {\n164:             return AiChatResponse.builder()\n165:                     .reply(\"🛡️ **QVS Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) Matrix**:\\n\\n\"\n166:                             + \"1. **System Administrator (`ROLE_ADMIN`)**:\\n\"\n167:                             + \"   • **Full Master Authority**: Can register qualifications, inspect system audit trails, and access real-time JVM telemetry.\\n\"\n168:                             + \"   • **Exclusive Revocation Power**: Only Administrators have the authority to revoke credentials on the blockchain.\\n\\n\"\n169:                             + \"2. **Registrar Officer (`ROLE_INSTITUTION`)**:\\n\"\n170:                             + \"   • **Institutional Registrar**: Can issue new academic credentials for their university and manage the institutional registry.\\n\"\n171:                             + \"   • **Access Restrictions**: **Cannot revoke credentials** (disciplinary/admin authority required) and cannot view internal server telemetry or audit trails.\\n\\n\"\n172:                             + \"3. **Accredited Verifier (`ROLE_VERIFIER`)**:\\n\"\n173:                             + \"   • **Verification Specialist**: Can perform instant qualification verification, inspect blockchain blocks, and run AI anomaly scans.\\n\"\n174:                             + \"   • **Access Restrictions**: Cannot browse student registries, cannot issue credentials, and cannot revoke records.\")\n175:                     .intent(\"EXPLAIN_ACCESS_LEVELS\")\n176:                     .status(\"INFO\")\n177:                     .timestamp(now)\n178:                     .build();\n179:         }\n180: \n181:         // 2. How to Verify\n182:         if (msg.contains(\"how\") && (msg.contains(\"verify\") || msg.contains(\"check\") || msg.contains(\"lookup\"))) {\n183:             return AiChatResponse.builder()\n184:                     .reply(\"💡 **How to Verify a Certificate**:\\n\\n\"\n185:                             + \"1. **Sign In**: Log into the portal using your accredited Verifier, Officer, or Admin account.\\n\"\n186:                             + \"2. **Open Console**: Navigate to the **'Verify Credential'** tab on your dashboard.\\n\"\n187:                             + \"3. **Enter Identifier**: Enter the Certificate Serial Number (e.g. `QVS-2024-BSC-8891`) or SHA-256 hash.\\n\"\n188:                             + \"4. **Validate**: Click **'Verify Authenticity'** to inspect the real-time institutional match, blockchain consensus, and AI anomaly heuristics.\")\n189:                     .intent(\"HOW_TO_VERIFY\")\n190:                     .status(\"INFO\")\n191:                     .timestamp(now)\n192:                     .build();\n193:         }\n194: \n195:         // 3. Explain Blockchain\n196:         if (msg.contains(\"blockchain\") || msg.contains(\"ledger\") || msg.contains(\"block\")) {\n197:             return AiChatResponse.builder()\n198:                     .reply(\"⛓️ **Cryptographic Blockchain Ledger Explained**:\\n\\n\"\n199:                             + \"Every qualification event (issuance or revocation) is cryptographically sealed into an immutable block containing a timestamp, previous block hash, and SHA-256 payload digest. This creates an unbroken cryptographic chain preventing retroactive diploma alteration or forged degrees.\")\n200:                     .intent(\"EXPLAIN_BLOCKCHAIN\")\n201:                     .status(\"INFO\")\n202:                     .timestamp(now)\n203:                     .build();\n204:         }\n205: \n206:         // 4. Explain AI Fraud Shield\n207:         if (msg.contains(\"ai\") && (msg.contains(\"fraud\") || msg.contains(\"anomaly\") || msg.contains(\"shield\") || msg.contains(\"score\"))) {\n208:             return AiChatResponse.builder()\n209:                     .reply(\"🤖 **Agentic AI Fraud Shield Heuristics**:\\n\\n\"\n210:                             + \"Our AI engine executes multi-vector anomaly detection:\\n\"\n211:                             + \"• **Cryptographic Check**: SHA-256 payload consistency.\\n\"\n212:                             + \"• **Chronology Check**: Validates conferment date feasibility.\\n\"\n213:                             + \"• **Pattern Recognition**: Validates ISO-standard serial entropy.\\n\"\n214:                             + \"• **Institutional Accreditation**: Confirms issuing body licensing.\\n\"\n215:                             + \"• **Disciplinary Check**: Flags any official revocation rulings.\")\n216:                     .intent(\"EXPLAIN_AI\")\n217:                     .status(\"INFO\")\n218:                     .timestamp(now)\n219:                     .build();\n220:         }\n221: \n222:         // 5. Dynamic Database Query (Zero Hallucinations)\n223:         List<Qualification> matches = findMatchingQualifications(rawMsg);\n224:         if (!matches.isEmpty()) {\n225:             Qualification q = matches.get(0);\n226:             AiAnalysisResultDto aiAnalysis = analyzeCertificate(q.getCertificateNumber());\n227: \n228:             StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n229:             sb.append(\"🔍 **Official Registry & Blockchain AI Record for \")\n230:               .append(q.getStudentFullName()).append(\" (`\").append(q.getCertificateNumber()).append(\"`)**:\\n\\n\");\n231:             sb.append(\"• **Status**: \").append(q.getStatus() == QualificationStatus.ACTIVE ? \"✅ **Active (Genuine & Valid)**\" : \"⚠️ **OFFICIALLY REVOKED**\").append(\"\\n\");\n232:             sb.append(\"• **Degree / Award**: \").append(q.getAwardTitle()).append(\" (\").append(q.getMajorSpecialization()).append(\")\\n\");\n233:             sb.append(\"• **Classification**: \").append(q.getClassification()).append(\"\\n\");\n234:             sb.append(\"• **Awarding Institution**: \").append(q.getInstitution() != null ? q.getInstitution().getName() : \"Accredited Body\").append(\"\\n\");\n235:             sb.append(\"• **Award Date**: \").append(q.getAwardDate()).append(\"\\n\");\n236:             sb.append(\"• **Student ID**: \").append(q.getStudentIdNumber()).append(\"\\n\");\n237: \n238:             if (q.getStatus() == QualificationStatus.REVOKED && q.getRevocationReason() != null) {\n239:                 sb.append(\"• **Revocation Ruling**: ⚠️ *\").append(q.getRevocationReason()).append(\"*\\n\");\n240:             }\n241: \n242:             sb.append(\"• **AI Fraud Score**: **\").append(aiAnalysis.getAuthenticityScore())\n243:               .append(\"/100 (\").append(aiAnalysis.getRiskLevel()).append(\" RISK)**\\n\");\n244:             sb.append(\"• **AI Recommendation**: \").append(aiAnalysis.getRecommendation());\n245: \n246:             return AiChatResponse.builder()\n247:                     .reply(sb.toString())\n248:                     .intent(q.getStatus() == QualificationStatus.ACTIVE ? \"VERIFY_ACTIVE\" : \"VERIFY_REVOKED\")\n249:                     .status(q.getStatus() == QualificationStatus.ACTIVE ? \"SUCCESS\" : \"WARNING\")\n250:                     .timestamp(now)\n251:                     .build();\n252:         }\n253: \n254:         // 6. If user tried to check a non-existent certificate\n255:         if (msg.contains(\"qvs-\") || msg.contains(\"check\") || msg.contains(\"verify\")) {\n256:             return AiChatResponse.builder()\n257:                     .reply(\"⚠️ **Institutional Registry Search Outcome**:\\n\\n\"\n258:                             + \"No accredited qualification record was found matching your query in the institutional database. \"\n259:                             + \"If this certificate was presented on physical paper or PDF, there is a **high risk of unauthorized alteration or forgery**.\")\n260:                     .intent(\"NOT_FOUND\")\n261:                     .status(\"WARNING\")\n262:                     .timestamp(now)\n263:                     .build();\n264:         }\n265: \n266:         // Generic intelligent fallback\n267:         return AiChatResponse.builder()\n268:                 .reply(\"Hello! I am your **QVS Agentic AI Assistant**. You can ask me to:\\n\\n\"\n269:                         + \"• Check specific student records (e.g., *'Check Sarah Jenkins'*, *'Check David Miller'*, or *'Check Marcus Vance'*)\\n\"\n270:                         + \"• Explain the **Access Levels between Admin, Officer, and Verifier**\\n\"\n271:                         + \"• Explain how the **Blockchain Ledger** ensures zero tampering\\n\"\n272:                         + \"• Inspect **AI Fraud Risk** rules and anomaly scoring\")\n273:                 .intent(\"GENERAL_ASSIST\")\n274:                 .status(\"INFO\")\n275:                 .timestamp(now)\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
