{"step_index":366,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:47:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T21:47:16+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T21:47:16+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/java/com/devops/qvs/service/AiFraudDetectionService.java`\nTotal Lines: 308\nTotal Bytes: 17063\nShowing lines 275 to 308\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n275:                 .timestamp(now)\n276:                 .build();\n277:     }\n278: \n279:     private List<Qualification> findMatchingQualifications(String query) {\n280:         if (query == null || query.isBlank()) {\n281:             return List.of();\n282:         }\n283:         try {\n284:             // First check direct certificate number format\n285:             for (String part : query.split(\"[^a-zA-Z0-9-]\")) {\n286:                 if (part.toUpperCase().startsWith(\"QVS-\")) {\n287:                     Optional<Qualification> byCert = qualificationRepository.findByCertificateNumber(part.toUpperCase());\n288:                     if (byCert.isPresent()) {\n289:                         return List.of(byCert.get());\n290:                     }\n291:                 }\n292:             }\n293: \n294:             // Next check search query\n295:             String cleanQuery = query.replaceAll(\"(?i)\\\\b(check|verify|inspect|who is|what is|tell me about|certificate|student)\\\\b\", \"\").trim();\n296:             if (!cleanQuery.isBlank()) {\n297:                 List<Qualification> results = qualificationRepository.searchQualifications(cleanQuery);\n298:                 if (results != null && !results.isEmpty()) {\n299:                     return results;\n300:                 }\n301:           